                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h5 style="margin-left:50px">To </h5>
                <h5 style="margin-left:100px">
                    <span>
                        @Model.departmentName <br />
                        @Model.DepartmentAddress <br />
                    </span>
                </h5>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span><strong>Subject :</strong></span> <span>Deployment of Manpower (outsource basis) final bill there of.</span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
                <h6>Dear Sir/Madam,</h6>
                <p style="text-indent:40px">
                    Please find enclosed herewith the sales bill(s) No. @Model.SaleBillNo  Dated: @Model.BillDate.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")
                    amounting to Rs. @Model.GrandBillAmount (@Model.GrandBillAmountWord) on account
                    of deployment of manpower services on outsourced basis, <span>BILL FOR THE MONTH OF APRIL 2026</span>
                </p>
                <p style="text-indent:40px">
                    It is therefore requested that necessary payment may kindly be released to this office through
                    cheque, Demand Draft or RTGS in favour of <span>MD HP STATE ELECTRONICS DEV CO LTD MEHLI SHIMLA (MANPOWER).</span>
                    The detail of Bank Account is as under:
                </p>
                <p style="margin-left:200px">
                    <strong> i) Account No. :</strong> <span> 1481102000000374</span><br />
                    <strong> ii) Bank Name : </strong> <span> IDBI Bank LTD</span><br />
                    <strong> iii) IFSC Code : </strong> <span> IBKL0001481</span>
                </p>
                <strong>Important Note :-</strong>
                <p style="margin-left:100px">
                    1. Please share the details of payment i.e. UTR No. in case of Bank to Bank transfer or Payee code in
                    case of Treasury payment to this office through official letter and/or e-mail :
                    manpowerpayment@hpsedc.in
                </p>
                <p style="margin-left:100px">
                    2. In case the payment being released has been clubbed for different bills generated by HPSEDC, then
                    the bill-wise details of the payment is to be provided separately by your organisation so that proper
                    reconciliation is done by HPSEDC with the bank statement.
                </p>
                <p style="margin-left:100px">
                    3. Please note that in case Bill-wise payment details are not received in HPSEDC, it will be difficult to
                    reconcile the payments and it will result in non-payment of wages to the deployed manpower on
                    outsource basis for which HPSEDC may not be held responsible.
                </p>
                <p style="margin-left:100px">
                    Thanking you and assuring our best service always.
                </p>
                <div style="text-align:right; ">
                    <span> Yours faithfully</span>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align:right; margin-top:50px;">
                    <span> Authorized Signatory</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    
</body>
</html>
